urname>Lang</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Reski</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Frank</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name><name><surname>Rensing</surname><given-names>SA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>PlanTAPDB, a Phylogeny-Based Resource of Plant Transcription-Associated Proteins</article-title><source>Plant Physiol</source><year>2007</year><volume>143</volume><fpage>1452</fpage><lpage>1466</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17337525</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1104/pp.107.095760</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B14"><citation citation-type="other"><article-title>Plant Transcription Factor Databases</article-title><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://planttfdb.cbi.pku.edu.cn/"/></citation></ref><ref id="B15"><citation citation-type="other"><article-title>PostgreSQL</article-title><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.postgresql.org/"/></citation></ref><ref id="B16"><citation citation-type="other"><article-title>National Center for Biotechnology Information</article-title><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/"/></citation></ref><ref id="B17"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Tamura</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Dudley</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Nei</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Kumar</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>MEGA4: Molecular Evolutionary Genetics Analysis (MEGA) Software Version 4.0</article-title><source>Mol Biol Evol</source><year>2007</year><volume>24</volume><fpage>1596</fpage><lpage>1599</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17488738</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1093/molbev/msm092</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B18"><citation citation-type="other"><article-title>European Sequencing of Tobacco Project </article-tit